Package: SMED
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Modelling of co-elution Mass Spectrometry Data
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("Qingzhou", "Zhang", 
                  email = "zqzneptune@hotmail.com", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Assigning probability scores to co-eluted proteins from biochemical
    fractionation mass spectrometry (BF-MS) experiments to infer 
    protein-protein interactions. The package integrates information-theoretic
    and statistical co-elution metrics using advanced machine learning models
    like XGBoost and Random Forest.
